	(text "VECTOR SELECT (U86): while an IRQ is pending, $FFFE/F read the entry of the highest-priority IRQ;\notherwise they read entry V (firmware software interrupts: write V, then BRK).\nCaveats: a BRK executed with IRQs masked while one is pending goes to that IRQ entry, and an IRQ\nwithdrawn before the vector fetch goes to entry V - handlers should check the B flag."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
